    "Disconnect is not cancellation progress is not completion and response replay never reexecutes an operation.",
    "Multi-client workspace overlay source authorization operation result and response-journal state is isolated.",
    "No default remote listener shell generic RPC plugin model execution editor setting mutation or automatic source edit.",
    "The shortest runnable implementation path is E0-A through E0-F; later governance and transports do not block the first executable bootstrap.",
